from fastapi import APIRouter, FastAPI

router = APIRouter(prefix="/items")  # not "/items/" and not "items"

@router.get("/{item_id}")
def read_item(item_id: int):
    return {"item_id": item_id}

app = FastAPI()
app.include_router(router, prefix="/api")  # serves /api/items/{item_id}
```

If prefixes come from configuration, normalize non-empty values with `"/" + value.strip("/")` before passing them in.

